WEBVTT

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:01.571
"Go out and fight it alone,"

00:12:01.571 --> 00:12:06.776
and more quests where he sees that it's his job to join a team,

00:12:06.776 --> 00:12:10.876
maybe a team led by women,

00:12:10.876 --> 00:12:16.496
to help other people become better

00:12:16.496 --> 00:12:18.888
and be better people,

00:12:18.888 --> 00:12:21.170
like the Wizard of Oz.

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:34.479
Thank you.